    "Additional positive pin finding: Net::close62E010 has the inline receiver loop62E184..62E1EC, then clears voice_key_D4_ at62E1F5 and voice_flags_D8_ again at62E1FB. The current body omits those post-clear writes. After coordinator confirms the complete pin sequence, restore those two named-field stores immediately after receiver clearing and before queue closes, retaining the earlier D8 reset. This is original-fidelity recovery, not a safety/behavior improvement.",
    "Adapt only existing test owner lookups/extraction affected by the genuine block transport; preserve all behavioral/layout/allocation/virtual-call and damage expectations. Add actual-source controls for nonempty/empty-head close paths, field/callback timing and the post-clear D4/D8 writes, plus compiled omissions/order mutants. Existing native compiler tests must run under a coordinator lease, not an unleased test import.",
    "Standing user authority: complete compiling bug-for-bug semantic coverage first, original byte-exact milestone thereafter; evidence-backed structural changes acted on immediately. Preserve all historical obligations and do not grant/demote claims by hand. This is coordinator-reviewed manual recovery, not native automatic acceptance.",
    "Root owns task metadata, source annotation publication, Git, resource leases, preparation, native compilation, integration and cleanup. Workers edit only specifically assigned files in isolated checkouts; no Wine/Git/package or master mutations. Return cross-owner discoveries before changing extra scope. Preserve all WIP and do not discard difficult algorithms or unrelated work.",
    "At most3 candidate compiler invocations per affected original per unchanged context, including compile errors. Initially one whole candidate source form; no spelling roulette, unchanged old profile/pointer-binding trials or byte-score-driven semantic regression. Root can preserve a justified structural migration with explicit matching obligations, never weaken an unknown into a pass.",
    "Require independent actual-source/pin review, fresh build/link and source/mapping/reference/claim checks, relevant host and compiling-damage controls, known exact/strict identity continuity, physical outside-scope comparison, then fresh serial destination verification. Baseline1a5f2853f and original image remain immutable; no reset to current working state. Missing full linked retention/allocation, structure/runtime/game and autonomous acceptance proofs remain explicit."
